---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: contentData.series
  size: 1
  alias: series
permalink: "/series/{{ series.slug }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ series.title }}"
---
{% from "components.njk" import storyCard, filterBar %}
{% set previewCount = (series.stories | length) - (series.publishedStories | length) %}
<div class="container page-main"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="面包屑"><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">首页</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">{{ series.title }}</span></nav><header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">场景系列 {{ '%02d' | format(series.order) }}</p><h1>{{ series.title }}</h1><p class="lead">{{ series.summary }}</p>{% if series.descriptionHtml %}{{ series.descriptionHtml | safe }}{% endif %}<span class="small">{% if series.publishedStories.length %}{{ series.publishedStories | length }} 篇{{ '理念' if series.format == 'brief' else '可读' }}{% endif %}{% if series.publishedStories.length and previewCount %} · {% endif %}{% if previewCount %}{{ previewCount }} 篇预告{% endif %}</span></header>
{% if series.publishedStories.length or previewCount %}
{{ filterBar(series.slug, false, contentData.series, taxonomy.axes.tags.items, series.coverage.tags, series.coverage.levels, series.publishedStories | length, previewCount) }}
{% if series.publishedStories.length %}<section data-published-list><h2>已发布</h2><div class="story-list" data-filter-list>{% for story in series.publishedStories %}{{ storyCard(story, contentData.series) }}{% endfor %}</div></section>{% endif %}
{% if previewCount %}<details class="preview-block" data-preview-block open><summary>接下来 · 预告 {{ previewCount }} 篇</summary><div class="story-list" data-filter-list>{% for story in series.stories %}{% if story.planned %}{{ storyCard(story, contentData.series) }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></details>{% endif %}
<div class="empty-state" data-empty hidden><h2>没有符合条件的{{ '理念' if series.format == 'brief' else '故事' }}</h2><p>试试减少标签，或把难度切回「全部」。筹备中的选项不会打开空列表。</p><button type="button" class="button" data-clear-filters>清除标签与难度</button></div>
{% else %}<aside class="preparing-block"><h2>这个场景正在筹备中</h2><p>内容供稿中。可先读「市场与周期 / 第一笔工资 / 买房与负债」。</p><a class="button" href="{{ '/series/markets-cycles/' | url }}">先读市场与周期</a></aside>{% endif %}</div>
